#code-block(size: 7.00pt)[#raw("martelage-verify — MARTELAGE-0.1 reference validator\n\npackage      vectors/01-minimal-conformant/pkg\ndigest       ab2bc3a563e26e1454400ba70cebad73a849d194bcd2c1d2787c0efaf3c2653c   (sha256 of package.json: this is the\n↳ package digest)\nstandard     martelage v1 (kind package-manifest)\nsubject      c419edf957fda5f89c2988273d3d00e9e5b2a69ebe7f6bca22644da52bc129f3 (kind note-log)\nproducer     example / by-hand 0 / contract martelage-example-notes 1\ncreated_at   1700000200\nprev         null (how: none)\nfiles        2\nrecords      2 over 1 stream(s)\n\nscope\n  contains:\n    - 2 record(s) on stream(s): note\n  not_contains:\n    - anything not listed above [not-recorded] this package is a hand-made example for the standard\n\nfiles\n  OK   records.jsonl                abf920fbb49003e1b06badc085e74f8396713bca64d2f123eccdb256e6a36bad  776 bytes \n↳ role=records\n  OK   notes.md                     6ed0b5af646aad99f7ae97d94c2a56623b36de11d5967af4fc508bececdbca10  55 bytes \n↳ role=document\n\nstreams\n  FILE                 STREAM           N     HEAD           VERDICT\n  records.jsonl        note             2     6e28c56d1a81   OK\n\nanchor\n  NOT ANCHORED — this package's digest is held by no one but its producer\n\nlayers\n  layer 0  body digests        checked\n  layer 1  stream continuity   checked\n  layer 2  package digest     ab2bc3a563e26e1454400ba70cebad73a849d194bcd2c1d2787c0efaf3c2653c\n  layer 3  package chain       not armed (no --prev-package given) — omission across packages is NOT checked\n  layer 4  anchor              not claimed by this package\n\nrefusals\n  none\n\nfindings\n  none\n\nignored\n  2 field(s) this validator does not know, counted per (object, field) — ignored, never guessed at (§5.2.11 MA-33,\n↳ §11.5 MA-80):\n  'records.jsonl' line 1     generator\n  'records.jsonl' line 1     counts\n\nnot decidable\n  nothing — every check this validator implements could reach a verdict on this package (MA-7