#block(width: measure, above: 0pt, below: 0.9em)[#text("Read the block in this order and the report tells you what it did and did not do. The ")#ic("layers")#text(" block names each layer and whether this run armed it. The ")#ic("anchor")#text(" block says, in words, that no one but the producer holds this digest. The ")#ic("residual")#text(" block is the §3.3 sentence, printed on every run that names a package. The ")#ic("ignored")#text(" and ")#ic("not decidable")#text(" blocks are sections of their own, so that a field the validator did not understand and a check it could not reach are never invisible (§10.4 items 9 and 10, MA-71).")]
